WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.607
Your app is ready.

2
00:00:01.967 --> 00:00:03.151
The paywall isn't.

3
00:00:03.697 --> 00:00:04.881
On Google Play,

4
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.901
a subscription screen has rules:

5
00:00:07.134 --> 00:00:09.153
the price, the billing period,

6
00:00:09.177 --> 00:00:10.326
the trial terms,

7
00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:12.195
and a clear note that it renews.

8
00:00:12.741 --> 00:00:15.039
Meet M3 Expressive Paywall.

9
00:00:15.586 --> 00:00:18.464
Six ready-made paywalls for Jetpack Compose,

10
00:00:18.756 --> 00:00:20.844
built with Material 3 Expressive.

11
00:00:21.484 --> 00:00:22.621
Classic plans.

12
00:00:23.144 --> 00:00:24.490
Free versus Pro.

13
00:00:25.013 --> 00:00:26.208
A trial timeline.

14
00:00:26.639 --> 00:00:28.275
A plan picker that morphs.

15
00:00:28.798 --> 00:00:30.132
A limited-time offer.

16
00:00:30.656 --> 00:00:32.315
And an onboarding finale.

17
00:00:32.955 --> 00:00:35.183
Pass in your plans and three callbacks.

18
00:00:35.706 --> 00:00:37.215
That's the whole API.

19
00:00:37.738 --> 00:00:40.930
Each screen writes the disclosure for the selected plan,

20
00:00:41.024 --> 00:00:43.972
with Restore, Terms and Privacy right below.

21
00:00:44.519 --> 00:00:45.760
Bring your own billing:

22
00:00:46.306 --> 00:00:47.583
Google Play Billing,

23
00:00:47.711 --> 00:00:50.160
RevenueCat, or your own backend.

24
00:00:50.707 --> 00:00:54.014
Light, dark and dynamic color come straight from your

25
00:00:53.922 --> 00:00:54.502
theme.

26
00:00:55.048 --> 00:00:56.615
It's free and open source.

27
00:00:57.069 --> 00:01:00.318
Get started at paywall.sanikant.dev.

